{
  "name": "craft-discipline",
  "description": "See · Understand · Help. WARSZAWASZA: docs/project.md · /field/heat",
  "rules": [
    "Filter: After using this, does the human understand their reality more easily and make a better decision? If not — remove it.",
    "Steps: See (raw facts, trajectories) → Understand (observation vs hypothesis) → Help (small change that works in the field).",
    "Loop: Reality → Observation → Small change → Re-observation. Reality has the last word.",
    "Evolve from what human and reality teach together — never replace human judgment or infer psychology.",
    "Genesis (personal, not docs): docs/identity/babcia-os-v1.md · Detail: .cursor/rules/core.mdc"
  ]
}
